# UNIT-III (b): Data Processing Using Apache Pig

## 1. Aim
To write Pig Latin scripts to process log files and calculate:
1. Total page views per hour per day.
2. Total page views per day.
3. Total page views for each hour across all days.
4. Word count using a text file as input.

## 2. Input Dataset

Each log record contains four fields separated by tab characters:

| Field | Description | Example |
|---|---|---|
| `site` | Website name | google.com |
| `hour_of_day` | Hour of the day | 10 |
| `page_views` | Number of page views | 100 |
| `data_date` | Date of the record | 2026-01-01 |

Example input:

```text
google.com    10    100    2026-01-01
youtube.com   10    150    2026-01-01
google.com    11    200    2026-01-01
google.com    10    120    2026-01-02
youtube.com   11    180    2026-01-02
```

**Important:** The actual fields must be separated by tab characters, not spaces.

