# Part C: Calculate Total Views per Day

### Objective
Calculate the total page views for each date.

### Pig Latin program: `views_per_day.pig`

```pig
logs = LOAD 'data/pig/simple_logs'
USING PigStorage('\t')
AS (
    site:chararray,
    hour_of_day:int,
    page_views:int,
    data_date:chararray
);

grouped_logs = GROUP logs BY data_date;

daily_views = FOREACH grouped_logs GENERATE
    group AS date,
    SUM(logs.page_views) AS total_page_views;

DUMP daily_views;
```

### Example output

```text
(2026-01-01,450)
(2026-01-02,300)
```

